# cargo-fuzz: build outputs, crash artifacts, and corpus all stay local.
# Per PRO-613, the corpus starts empty and is added selectively only if
# signal-producing seeds emerge — at which point a fuzz/corpus/<target>/
# directory can be added to git via `git add -f`.
fuzz/target
fuzz/artifacts
fuzz/corpus
fuzz/Cargo.lock
